        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    principal = 300_000\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.04\n    loan_term_years = 30\n    monthly_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    number_of_payments = loan_term_years * 12\n\n    # Calculate the monthly payment and total interest\n    monthly_payment = principal * monthly_rate / (\n        1 - (1 + monthly_rate) ** -number_of_payments\n    )\n    total_interest = monthly_payment * number_of_payments - principal\n\n    # Return interest rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(total_interest)\n```",
